{"1827690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CHEMISTS: Area of infection", "steam_appid": 1827690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHEMISTS: Dead Zone - RE-RELEASE NOW AVAILABLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main development is complete. No updates are planned for this version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your support!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chemists: Area of infection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person shooter set in an alternate reality. A year after a global catastrophe, you wake up in a hospital with no memory of anything. You must not only find out what happened but also try to survive in this harsh, dangerous world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to rely entirely on your navigation skills and memorize almost everything—where you've been and where you need to go—to survive and avoid getting lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game world is vast and requires special attention to detail, as you can encounter unexplained phenomena, encounter swarms of mutants, or become trapped by anomalies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game plunges you into a dangerous and harsh world where danger can lurk at every turn. You'll need to manage not only thirst and satiety, but also stamina and other environmental hazards that directly impact your survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to fight for resources against bandits and mercenaries, as well as for your life against monsters and mutants, using a variety of combat methods. Different weapons will allow you to accurately assess your strength against different types of enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival to the fullest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore aspects of some gameplay elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive exploration of locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and their rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of points of interest</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHEMISTS: Dead Zone - RE-RELEASE NOW AVAILABLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main development is complete. No updates are planned for this version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your support!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chemists: Area of infection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person shooter set in an alternate reality. A year after a global catastrophe, you wake up in a hospital with no memory of anything. You must not only find out what happened but also try to survive in this harsh, dangerous world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to rely entirely on your navigation skills and memorize almost everything—where you've been and where you need to go—to survive and avoid getting lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game world is vast and requires special attention to detail, as you can encounter unexplained phenomena, encounter swarms of mutants, or become trapped by anomalies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game plunges you into a dangerous and harsh world where danger can lurk at every turn. You'll need to manage not only thirst and satiety, but also stamina and other environmental hazards that directly impact your survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to fight for resources against bandits and mercenaries, as well as for your life against monsters and mutants, using a variety of combat methods. Different weapons will allow you to accurately assess your strength against different types of enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >